@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam activityFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam activityBorderColor #2E86AB

title <b>Predictive & Adaptive Hardware Protection System</b>

|#E3F2FD| <b> SENSOR ACQUISITION LAYER </b> |
start
:<b>HARDWARE INPUT STREAM</b>
----
<b>I2C Bus (INA219):</b>
- Voltage (V), Current (I)

<b>GPIO Bus (thermal_zone0):</b>
- Temperature (T)

<b>Telemetry Stream:</b>
- CPU %, Queue Depth

//(Sampled every 2 sec from edge device)//;

:<b>1. SENSOR FUSION & DATA ACQUISITION</b>
----
- PhysicsSimulator captures raw signals
- Creates <b>SensorReading</b> (T, V, I, CPU%, Q)
- Stores in <b>SensorHistory</b> (Buffer depth=10)
- Timestamp alignment & calibration;

:<b>2. DERIVATIVE COMPUTATION</b>
----
- <b>dT/dt</b>: Thermal velocity (C/min)
- <b>dV/dt</b>: Voltage drop rate (V/sec)
- <b>sigma_V</b>: Voltage instability (Std Dev)
- Load Pressure: CPU x 0.7 + Q x 0.3;

|#E8F5E9| <b> RISK ASSESSMENT LAYER </b> |
:<b>3. SIX-TERM RISK SCORE ENGINE</b>
----
<b>R = Sum(wi xi), i=1..6</b>

- x1: Thermal Proximity (w=0.15)
- <b>x2: Thermal Velocity (w=0.25)</b>
- x3: Voltage Sag (w=0.15)
- <b>x4: Voltage Drop Rate (w=0.20)</b>
- x5: Voltage Instability (w=0.10)
- x6: Load Pressure (w=0.15)

<b>R guaranteed in [0, 1]</b>;

:<b>4. DUAL-HYSTERESIS STATE MACHINE</b>
----
SAFE->WARN: R>=0.30 | WARN->SAFE: R<0.25
WARN->CRIT: R>=0.65 | CRIT->WARN: R<0.55
CRIT->EMERG: R>=0.85

<b>States: SAFE | WARNING | CRITICAL | EMERGENCY</b>;

|#FFF3E0| <b> TASK ROUTING LAYER </b> |
:<b>5. DUAL-GATE ADMISSION CONTROLLER</b>
----
<b>Input:</b> Task (ID, Weight, Priority)

<b>Gate 1 - STATE:</b>
SAFE: All local | WARN: Lightweight local
CRIT: Mission-critical only | EMERG: Throttle

<b>Gate 2 - BUDGET:</b>
B_t = floor(B_max x (1-R) - C_w)
B_max=10, Window=30s, Replenish R<0.25;

|#E8F5E9| <b> PROTECTIVE EXECUTION LAYER </b> |
:<b>ROUTING DECISION</b>;

split
  :<b>A. LOCAL EXECUTION</b>
  //(SAFE State)//
  ----
  - Standard task processing
  - Hardware utilization monitored
  - Budget consumed per task;
split again
  :<b>B. CLOUD OFFLOADING</b>
  //(WARNING/CRITICAL + Net)//
  ----
  - Cloud API Handoff (JSON)
  - Remote execution
  - No local CPU impact;
split again
  :<b>C. EMERGENCY THROTTLING</b>
  //(EMERGENCY / No Net)//
  ----
  - Sleep interleaving (500ms)
  - Passive cooling interval
  - Non-critical tasks REJECTED;
end split

|#F3E5F5| <b> OUTCOME & TELEMETRY LAYER </b> |
:<b>6. SYSTEM HEALTH OUTCOME</b>
----
- Hardware Preservation
- Reduced Brownouts/Thermal Shutdowns
- Application Uptime Maintenance
- Physical Degradation Prevention;

:<b>TELEMETRY LOGGING (CSV)</b>
----
- Sensor readings + derivatives
- Risk terms (x1..x6) + R score
- State, budget, routing decisions

//(Post-hoc analysis & patent evidence)//;
stop
@enduml
